title: "COINCIDENCE Algorithms Suite"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-10
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  A reusable Python suite of COINcidence algorithms, histogram sampling
  variants, multi-objective selection, permutation-problem contracts, and
  reproducible teaching and research examples.
